<title>UK: Rolls-Royce says to develop power station.</title>
<headline>Rolls-Royce says to develop power station.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rolls-Royce Plc said on Monday that it had signed a joint venture agreement with Northern Electric Plc to develop, own and operate a 50 MW natural gas-fired power station.</p>
<p>The new joint venture is owned on a 50/50  basis by Rolls-Royce Power Ventures and Northern Electric Generation. Rolls-Royce said the capital cost of the venture, to be located at Seal Sands on Teesside, northeast England,is 17 million stg.</p>
<p>The commercial operation date for the project is November 1997.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
